{"id":"derzeit","lemma":"derzeit","pos":"adv","rank":3579,"glosses":["currently, at present (implying that this state is likely temporary)"],"ipa":"/ˈdeːɐ̯t͡saɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/15/De-derzeit.ogg/De-derzeit.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wo arbeitest du derzeit?","en":"Where do you work now?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756940","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin derzeit sehr beschäftigt.","en":"I've been very busy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"busy (engaged in an…"}]},{"text":"Die Preise sind derzeit hoch.","en":"Prices are high at the moment.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"price","l":"Preis"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"high, tall"}]},{"text":"Ich arbeite derzeit als Lehrer an der Schule.","en":"I'm currently working at the school as a teacher.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"to teach","l":"lehren"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Ich habe derzeit kein Interesse an einem Freund.","en":"I'm not interested in having a boyfriend at this point.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"interest"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"friend"}]}]}